  "body": "Elevated and positioned to capture breathtaking coastal views, 26 Monyash Road presents an exceptional opportunity to secure a substantial family home on an impressive 1,171m² freehold section in one of Manly's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nEnjoying a prized north-east-facing position, the home showcases sweeping views across Manly and Tindalls Beaches, stretching towards Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nSpanning three levels, this five-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom residence offers space, flexibility and privacy, ideal for growing families, extended family living or those wanting room to enjoy the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe middle level forms the heart of the home, where the kitchen, dining and main living areas open onto a generous deck with expansive sea views. A wood burner provides warmth through the cooler months, while an additional bedroom offers flexibility for family or guests.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, three double bedrooms provide separation from the main living areas, with access to the outdoor deck, gardens and private spa. Occupying the uppermost level, the fifth bedroom enjoys uninterrupted ocean views, creating a peaceful retreat above it all.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, the substantial 1,171m² freehold landholding is a standout feature. With expansive outdoor areas, established gardens and plenty of room for children and pets, the property offers space and freedom rarely found in such a desirable coastal location.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Elevated 1,171m² freehold section\r\n- Five bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms across three levels\r\n- North-east-facing with sweeping sea views\r\n- Generous living areas and entertaining decks\r\n- New interior paint and carpet throughout\r\n- Private outdoor spa and established gardens\r\n- Double internal-access garage and off-street parking\r\n- Dedicated boat parking\r\n- Wood burner for winter comfort\r\n- Weather-tightness report available\r\n- Close to Manly and Tindalls Beaches, shops, cafés and schools\r\n- Easy access to Gulf Harbour Marina and coastal walkways\r\n\r\nOffering an outstanding combination of land, lifestyle, space and coastal views, 26 Monyash Road is a property that deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nContact Mitchell or the team today to arrange your private viewing.",
